[{"title":"诚台春色","author":"薛季宣","text":"凤阙西冈，郎亭东乳。\n惟竹猗猗，诚台有楚。\n苔痕春绿，玉李晚风。\n屏山坐对，青葱数峰。\n颓墙色弄，文杏新红。\n争鲜竞秀，芳随意远。\n各称时宜，自成深浅。\n妙意谁传，叵形罨画。\n羲皇晚生，先天后卦。\n江湖涨绿，旋拍沧洲。\n晴岚翠滴，烟瘴悠悠。\n篁鞭破藓，柳带萦愁。\n亦有江梅，花残未落。\n弄音好鸟，笙簧度曲。\n堆如瓦鼓，幽独是称。\n兀坐颓然，邑荒无政。\n新阳多感，雷鼓轰天。\n清淮咫尺，狼烽夕烟。\n暮四朝三，谁为第一。\n不知其它，且以永日。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23320,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春江夕泛二首 其一","author":"薛季宣","text":"短棹春江里，桃花流水生。\n天高装镜净，岸远笔山横。\n落日无穷意，丹霞逐旋明。\n何时遂归志，一叶任纵横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23321,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春江夕泛二首 其二","author":"薛季宣","text":"夕泛春江里，扁舟万里心。\n仰头竟空碧，疏樾成清阴。\n浩志曷可遂，归怀讵能寻。\n波随乱山急，意若□流深。\n日落洲上苇，霞生雾堆金。\n重渊狎已贯，飘风顾难禁。\n岩峦多李花，冰霜积梅林。\n为何纵松舟，且以开吾襟。\n迎送未云已，浮云逐行吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23322,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"俞氏园林","author":"薛季宣","text":"茁茁桃与李，生花故城山。\n修竹共娟好，流水相往还。\n天远峰可续，人来心已闲。\n殷红间苍白，晚吹催潺湲。\n吾邑在何许，沧波对重关。\n烟霞蔽落日，萑苇深前湾。\n送客时已到，游人意长悭。\n高风怒涛作，卷雪食饷间。\n官禁不可脱，归哉望斓斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23323,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石门渔舍","author":"薛季宣","text":"渔家在何许，舛駮岩下石。\n花树几株芳，湖山数峰碧。\n窊樽亭遂古，双阙天自辟。\n锦绣入茨舍，藤萝封筀栅。\n吾为江上游，形苦世间役。\n心驰定沙步，舟行过檐隙。\n浪翁底镌铭，太尉此居宅。\n岂若斯人徒，风云相主客。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23324,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕","author":"薛季宣","text":"元夕不作会，莲灯相照明。\n影光严铁马，欢噪合金城。\n发策闷如醉，中庭空自行。\n月娥云镜暗，樽酒为谁倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23325,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月夜郊行","author":"薛季宣","text":"旷野久晴霁，月娥添夜明。\n光浮渰水白，寒彻纩衣清。\n颇复蓝关意，端为剡县行。\n灏然天宇内，应不负平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23326,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书三首寄景望 其一 春秋","author":"薛季宣","text":"非复东都会，书王春又春。\n退风飞宋鹢，远狩获西麟。\n孔志知安在，豳诗难重陈。\n焚香掩卷坐，歌咏忽臣邻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23327,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书三首寄景望 其二 山海经","author":"薛季宣","text":"帝江无目面，歌舞识成音。\n形天断厥首，操干意岑崟。\n大化浩难量，悬解在明心。\n舒啸东皋上，薰风五弦琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23328,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书三首寄景望 其三 韩文","author":"薛季宣","text":"退之强解事，刚不信神仙。\n所作古意诗，甘心玉井莲。\n沈疴痊不见，险绝恸虚传。\n赖得华阴令，聱书言岂然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23329,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游竹陵善权洞二首 其一","author":"薛季宣","text":"万古英台面，云泉响佩环。\n练衣归洞府，香雨落人间。\n蝶舞疑山魄，花开想玉颜。\n几如禅观适，游魶戏澄湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23330,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游竹陵善权洞二首 其二","author":"薛季宣","text":"左右蜗蛮战，晨昏燕蝠争。\n九星宁曲照，三洞独何营。\n世事嗟兴丧，人情见死生。\n阿谁能种玉，还尔石田耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23331,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"都场正月尽未见梅思雪中石门之游作 其一","author":"薛季宣","text":"千里春何晚，三旬暖不回。\n眼青暝县柳，粉白闷宫梅。\n丽水年时泛，桃花雪里开。\n轩辕丘一梦，怀往意悠哉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23332,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"都场正月尽未见梅思雪中石门之游作 其二","author":"薛季宣","text":"谢客穷幽处，仙宫隐薜萝。\n二峰峨魏阙，双瀑泻天河。\n犺獚应难致，猿猴却患多。\n雪中山更好，淹岁定如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23333,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"薛季宣","text":"花实望先进，英华标素王。\n竹篱眠夜月，风雪傲寒塘。\n皎皎曾无对，凄凄忽有香。\n和羹须鼎味，盛服也霓裳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23334,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴江放船至枫桥湾","author":"薛季宣","text":"短篷负长虹，破䉬挂明月。\n风马座中生，天幕波中出。\n高城多隐映，远岫搀罗列。\n少小泛吴江，始识仙凡别。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23335,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读春秋有感","author":"薛季宣","text":"巧辩鸡三足，曾窥豹两斑。\n凤衰歌已过，麟获涕为潸。\n妄作南柯郡，间争左角蛮。\n梦回无个事，风雨度前山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23336,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送士昭兄赴南外敦宗院二首 其一","author":"薛季宣","text":"人道温陵郡，山川似洛阳。\n怀兄尚淹滞，敦族暂翱翔。\n会见亲先汉，方期变有唐。\n万安秋夜月，多称古文章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23337,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送士昭兄赴南外敦宗院二首 其二","author":"薛季宣","text":"忆昔南州去，松根眺邑廛。\n鸟啼云里树，人入洞中天。\n载陟今时路，须航古渡船。\n地穷巇崄尽，蚤晚济平川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23338,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观天德图像二首 其一","author":"薛季宣","text":"函封传远边，瞥见藁街悬。\n虎喙终为啖，狼心约下贤。\n时无汉延寿，天夺晋苻坚。\n请决春秋事，陈侯讣岂然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23339,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观天德图像二首 其二","author":"薛季宣","text":"鸣镝心何悖，投鞭计亦休。\n传闻广陵散，因作畔牢愁。\n淝水真同道，黄池故不侔。\n见遗天授像，看是郅支头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23340,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤淮帅","author":"薛季宣","text":"淮浦天龙战，居巢塞马归。\n阵伤军背水，机失寇踰淝。\n越石知何在，虞君恨曷依。\n都缘生过涉，谁为斩何徽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23341,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"袁口回棹有感","author":"薛季宣","text":"放舟谷里口，乘流楚江干。\n钓台亦已堕，大舶宁长安。\n春度乱山绿，风回平水湍。\n何须问今古，劫劫难为观。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23342,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白发","author":"薛季宣","text":"浮生宁久客，罢沐弹冠帻。\n芳树几时红，童发半茎白。\n千月浪翻涛，百龄驹过隙。\n多少少年人，乌头问华箦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23343,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"樊口晨泛送程端卿","author":"薛季宣","text":"扁舟送归客，万籁寂无风。\n宿雾青郊暗，卿云碧岭空。\n水清明去鹭，天远入征鸿。\n日脚中流见，委蛇走白虹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23344,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒溪堂有待","author":"薛季宣","text":"疏雨渡西关，寒溪亦厚颜。\n风和沈白浪，云敛出青山。\n浩荡鸥偏适，翔飞鹭自闲。\n可堪泥染鞅，行客马班班。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23345,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夜斋居","author":"薛季宣","text":"汉家传旧事，太一祀中庭。\n宫架崇乔岳，银釭耀列星。\n九阶尘扰扰，万室火荧荧。\n兀坐闻迂叟，无人尚典刑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23346,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读列女传","author":"薛季宣","text":"一避先生席，铿然鼓瑟希。\n功名窗纸薄，声色路尘微。\n大礼无通问，清谈浪解围。\n党人狂斐甚，犹有咏雩归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23347,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读骨鲠集","author":"薛季宣","text":"几许兴亡事，全归喜怒中。\n鹳鸣非雨候，花落任春风。\n龙马符虽在，檀槐战已空。\n未须悲麦秀，王道有车攻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23348,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"县民诉事有以禅僧见况者","author":"薛季宣","text":"讼庭披诉者，道我似禅僧。\n不悟无生理，安知最上乘。\n修行心懒慢，溘睡日瞢腾。\n说法还知否，宰官非所能。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23349,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"士昭兄琴室","author":"薛季宣","text":"弄琴函丈者，无始到来今。\n韶濩五弦上，乾坤三古心。\n荷香流曲沼，烟雨抹寒林。\n闵子罢倾听，何人知此音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23350,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武昌射圃后山与江接走植柳竹方茂每为民家羊群所龁日有殴羊之事昔赞皇公以祝鸡翁自况走亦可谓牧羊儿矣","author":"薛季宣","text":"有欲即有累，无营了无为。\n且非割鸡宰，宁是牧羊儿。\n甲解木方遂，苞屯芽定萎。\n江山万里道，好去莫迟疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23351,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乳鹿或得之近山既不可纵畜之更日而驯走命之曰山友","author":"薛季宣","text":"驹鹿何年致，它山小水滨。\n呦呦兴念母，麌麌熟依人。\n物性初无定，野心时亦驯。\n故林迷町疃，结友幸相亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23352,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乳猫","author":"薛季宣","text":"乳猫毛比雪，卉服絮成衣。\n扼鼠气方盛，食牛形但微。\n纷拿殊矍铄，上下拟腾飞。\n几许明眸子，亏盈望日晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23353,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芍药","author":"薛季宣","text":"萃拔秀群芳，花间得素王。\n牡丹红树色，菡萏碧池香。\n融泄云何乐，熙怡日是常。\n问人伊谑事，士女熟相忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23354,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"殊亭","author":"薛季宣","text":"指掌视吴都，游人望已殊。\n清江浮晚岸，绿野涨春湖。\n我乏渊明事，谁为漫叟徒。\n醉心寻古记，始信不虚诬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23355,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食雨 其一","author":"薛季宣","text":"风雨逢寒食，天公涕亦潸。\n柳眉颦绿发，花泪湿朱颜。\n贴峤云横水，藏舟雾障湾。\n烧痕青已遍，若个子推山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23356,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食雨 其二","author":"薛季宣","text":"客里换春衣，寒风带雨霏。\n渐班榆火禁，初感塞鸿归。\n柳絮莺啼乱，梨花蝶趁飞。\n丘原坛祭耳，悲念切更微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23357,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"袁口舟行值雨","author":"薛季宣","text":"樊楚劳形甚，将迎一溯流。\n棹移惊立鸟，帆远乱浮沤。\n落漠江皋树，依稀荻岸舟。\n乌云鸣雨急，还我旧神游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23358,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酴醾雨后 其一","author":"薛季宣","text":"晼晚春阑雨，酴醾花意秋。\n雪飞香霰集，龙斗玉云浮。\n外户杨青眼，中唐浪白头。\n梦回人不见，心醉兀悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23359,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酴醾雨后 其二","author":"薛季宣","text":"玩世无心子，成功不义侯。\n升沈三跃浪，聚散一浮沤。\n守郡官槐木，王家梦髑髅。\n团团天上月，犹自曲如钩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23360,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"?花唐玉蕊花介甫谓之玚花鲁直谓之山矾武昌山中多有之其叶可供染事土人用之酿酒","author":"薛季宣","text":"?绿吐瑶琨，泠然郭外村。\n仙人来玉蕊，文士立山矾。\n芳泽留丝素，风流付酒樽。\n莫言玚酷似，香处不胜繁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23361,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春霖未霁澍雨大作","author":"薛季宣","text":"甚雨过清明，侵淫不肯晴。\n天占符后甲，人意失先庚。\n陌路河鱼上，阶塘野草生。\n早来云陡黑，流澍霫间成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23362,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书江表志","author":"薛季宣","text":"株守生财道，棋翻正国成。\n周王方虎噬，唐后独牛耕。\n军罢心忘战，民劳势自倾。\n谁如内史铉，求伴大夫平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23363,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏日昼寝","author":"薛季宣","text":"至乐归灵囿，栖神得睡乡。\n青奴凉自惬，班友梦偏长。\n莫管黄粱熟，何须绿醑尝。\n知他人世界，若处有虞唐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23364,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏口怀旧","author":"薛季宣","text":"夏口伤前事，毛精泪暗垂。\n白龟生不报，黄鹄去无期。\n岭雪炎云炽，瓜田古岸移。\n战尘愁满眼，聊付一篇诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23365,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒溪寺拈香时国丧罢宴锡已三岁二首 其一","author":"薛季宣","text":"社舞莫㛹娟，当修晋白莲。\n林梢开远嶂，花片落寒泉。\n钟鼓铿锵甚，松篁影带妍。\n如来本无象，长老亦逃禅。\n昔者溪为虎，如今突暂烟。\n万松晨径滑，九曲夏云连。\n畦町苗初实，池塘滴尚涓。\n洁斋朝五日，清净乐三年。\n要祝南山寿，南山寿十千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23366,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒溪寺拈香时国丧罢宴锡已三岁二首 其二","author":"薛季宣","text":"朝衣结蓝绶，古刹礼青莲。\n茜绚林间树，琤瑽竹下泉。\n晨曦方散彩，晓宿有馀妍。\n聚石应闻道，无人为说禅。\n路回荒翳目，江远望生烟。\n略彴溪源旧，孱颜岭岫连。\n清神山历历，洗耳涧涓涓。\n菩萨行观世，封人愿祝年。\n更须东亩粟，长穗满三千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23367,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石榴花","author":"薛季宣","text":"国色宜炎夏，宫装染绛纱。\n苍崖陆浑火，朱景赤城霞。\n颜驻留琼蕊，丹成咽日华。\n东山旧游处，遥忆武陵家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23368,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自讼","author":"薛季宣","text":"学问非干禄，宦游端为贫。\n生惭挽船令，羞杀采芝人。\n求牧知平陆，无浆卖棘津。\n读书心愧否，何日是来春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23369,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读李斯传","author":"薛季宣","text":"上蔡游公子，真情本自愚。\n五刑身具论，七罪法当诛。\n逐兔踪牵狗，亡秦效击胡。\n明功与周召，为问骊山徒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23370,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿低寨遇雨","author":"薛季宣","text":"酣睡忽惊觉，空床秋气清。\n四垂来雨脚，万壑涨滩声。\n飞洒穿戎幕，凄凉怅旅情。\n缇幢高卧者，应更薄书生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23371,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至信阳宿萧安抚寨萧虏蔡将去岁陷信阳者","author":"薛季宣","text":"左角语争战，南柯闻大奔。\n胡为控弦去，犹有覆车存。\n行客应贪路，边城不闭门。\n夜眠思往旧，空泪湿床痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23372,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别元可元亨","author":"薛季宣","text":"去矣鸱夷子，片帆移夕阳。\n意深三折臂，情结九回肠。\n风雨思无晦，江湖道可忘。\n死生犹暂别，万里未为长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23373,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"县有父子讼者走以鲁人之法听之喜其改悔而作","author":"薛季宣","text":"父子本天性，情缘私爱暌。\n宁留今夕忍，无作望思悲。\n克己归仁礼，回心即孝慈。\n同年千古意，圣相不吾欺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23374,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"樊冈雨后瀰望皆平芜绿草无复花矣","author":"薛季宣","text":"候客樊冈道，新晴致日佳。\n万般诗外意，百种梦中花。\n蔓绿铺平野，江流袭涨沙。\n无如石头滑，龙首粲新芽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23375,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父二首 其一","author":"薛季宣","text":"踪迹五湖浪，生涯千尺纶。\n是非宁入耳，荣辱不关身。\n猎猎菰蒲暮，凄凄浦溆春。\n何时共蓑笠，和雨钓青蘋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23376,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父二首 其二","author":"薛季宣","text":"红蓼白蘋岸，清风江月明。\n万波千尺动，四海一沤轻。\n浊酒醉独酌，鲜鱼饥旋烹。\n兴来歌欸乃，烟雨过前汀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23377,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"筠乡新笋","author":"薛季宣","text":"根节凌槐夏，风霜阅草春。\n此君椽笔健，稚子锦绷新。\n有待瞻淇奥，行将满渭滨。\n狂鞭任奔迸，我不是馋人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23378,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白菊","author":"薛季宣","text":"不著金缕衣，寒窗弄明月。\n端宜装淡泊，自是香蓬馞。\n臭味真可人，风流到华发。\n试为问东篱，定得渊明骨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23379,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁香花","author":"薛季宣","text":"别是南州种，寒花七里香。\n玉笄骈宝髻，金粟缀银珰。\n自得山林趣，不为时世装。\n紫霞休骋瑞，未及野梅芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23380,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春","author":"薛季宣","text":"谁得东君信，风生十万家。\n土牛占谷麦，灰律动蒹葭。\n嫩绿萌芳蕊，新红茁绽芽。\n未能都免俗，春胜插春花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23381,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪","author":"薛季宣","text":"怪得寒风瘦，窗明积渐加。\n起来裘泼水，逆视竹生花。\n厚貌分群品，新装副六珈。\n飘零飞落叶，转动绞回车。\n无定从高下，忘形变迩遐。\n郊坰铺毳罽，阶砌撒江沙。\n洒壁侵修饰，填坑旋不洼。\n屋头昂怪兽，山脊走长蛇。\n万木枝都亚，中庭石尽遮。\n狮符蹲陡踞，龙井喷增呀。\n扑面轻盈甚，装衣点缀斜。\n础闲开匣镜，碑仆插梳牙。\n同色连千里，虚光合万家。\n压灾时世重，为瑞老农誇。\n势极云天际，威凌冻水涯。\n凹兜坡崿岝，条突树牙槎。\n客子衣裳怯，王孙酒力奢。\n影浮垂绣幌，香带落梅花。\n筛簸知神女，门屯想夜叉。\n未能三十韵，旋瀹试烹茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23382,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊迎赵漕","author":"薛季宣","text":"叱御逆轺车，愁先负弩驱。\n虎头晴在望，羊角淖盈途。\n草莽迷行迹，湖山出画图。\n伤今又怀古，坐睡觉吴歈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23383,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"传闻北虏请和","author":"薛季宣","text":"会稽吴功薄，夫椒越报深。\n汉驱胡远遁，周任狄来侵。\n赖是佛狸死，何当颉利禽。\n请和君信否，无故莫容心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":23384,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]